messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: parser.c
Line: 9551
Function: xmlParseContentInternal
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: Directly accesses cur[1] without ensuring at least two bytes are available in the input buffer. If the current position is the last byte (e.g., input ends with '<'), cur[1] reads one byte past the buffer end, causing an out-of-bounds read.

